  "purpose": "S5 adjacent-frame Zh001r association and optional appearance training. Requires the public node/image pack and the private row-aligned identity sidecar, freezes the detector byte-for-byte, stores complete resume state, and emits training artifacts only. No submission. 2026-08-27: initialises from OUR out-of-fold split_0 (trained on 6bba, 44b6 held out - aryaarun07/biohub-oof-weights) so the fold-0 LOEO transfer gate (deploy_h1r_edge_s5_loeo_f0.json) is clean; fails closed unless both init globs hit exactly once. LEVER-0023 stage 1, PKT-0019.",
  "artifact_role": "training",
  "deploy_consumers": [
    {
      "artifact": "edge_predictor_best.pth",
      "spec": "scripts/kaggle_specs/deploy_h1r_edge_s5_loeo_f0.json"
